# juliet-kyle mimeapps.list: replaces Juliet's, to make Zen the default
# browser (Zen comes from this extension's DNFfile).
#
# Overrides the distro defaults in /usr/share/applications/mimeapps.list, which
# is where Fedora's firefox-as-default-browser comes from.
#
# Scoped deliberately to web browsing: Zen also declares handlers for PDFs,
# images, and media, but those are left to their own defaults rather than
# routed through the browser.
#
# Caveat: some apps rewrite this file (xdg-settings, gio mime, "make me your
# default browser" prompts). Because stow symlinks it into this repo, such a
# write lands on the tracked file — check `git diff` here if a default changes
# on its own.

[Default Applications]
x-scheme-handler/http=zen-browser.desktop
x-scheme-handler/https=zen-browser.desktop
text/html=zen-browser.desktop
application/xhtml+xml=zen-browser.desktop
x-scheme-handler/claude-cli=claude-code-url-handler.desktop
